Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:11.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The precious bottle I received for passing Ioryogi-san’s test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:20.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When this is filled, my wish will come true and I’ll be able to go to the place I want to. Right, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.86,0:00:23.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder when it will be filled?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:25.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We are looking forward to it, right, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.92,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:31.67,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,…you are the one who should fill it up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Opening~!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.36,0:02:03.79,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:09.12,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So far you only have the bottle. Nothing’s started yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.12,0:02:11.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you collecting in that bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:15.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’m collecting people’s broken hearts, Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:17.10,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you need to do to collect them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:21.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I need to heal those broken hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:25.18,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,All right. It seems you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.18,0:02:27.49,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Now you’d better start collecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:28.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.35,0:02:30.40,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I forgot to mention something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:35.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,When you’re with a human, do not talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:37.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:41.35,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’re not the sharpest tool in the shed, so I’ll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:48.15,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Stuffed animals don’t usually talk, and if you talk to inanimate objects, you’ll look strange. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:51.75,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, why don’t they talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:54.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Because they’re stuffed animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:58.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But why don’t they talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.74,KM,Iorygoi,0000,0000,0000,,Just hurry up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.32,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:12.40,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get off the see-saw so suddenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:15.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is anyone here feeling hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:19.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Does anyone here want to be healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:22.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t there anyone here who feels hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:25.84,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please let me heal your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.75,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, I’m in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:31.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. Isn’t there any way I can be of service?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.30,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:37.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t there anything I can help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:39.54,KO,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors! Tie{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:42.90,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, please help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:46.61,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,We need someone to be “it” for Kick the Can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:47.50,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:50.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If I’m “it”, will I be helping you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.48,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Yup! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:57.07,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I kicked the can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.65,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.31,0:04:26.68,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, that’s strange. There’s still nothing in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:29.81,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you helping by playing Kick the Can?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:33.34,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You aren’t helping anyone by doing stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:35.08,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:38.95,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’re just being a playmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.95,0:04:40.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:46.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Meeting someone by chance who needs healing is really hard, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:57.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But if there’s no one who needs healing, then nobody’s hurt or sad, and that’s a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:02.14,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Quite the little optimist, aren’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.19,0:05:10.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I think finding a way to help\Nsomeone out would be good, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:11.89,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:16.37,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,G-Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is this… for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:23.18,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:28.51,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Handing out such wonderful things without hesitation…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:30.91,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What a wonderful person!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:33.18,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:36.36,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,I still have all these to hand out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:39.48,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,so if you could take as many as you want, it’d really help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:40.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:42.91,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then I’ll take them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:43.63,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:48.57,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks! You sure saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.57,0:05:52.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I really helped him and now I’ve got all of these wonderful things!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:56.04,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But what are you going to do with all of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:06:01.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Now, it’s my turn to hand these wonderful things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.13,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:07.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please have one of these wonderful tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:10.91,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,These are very handy, so please help yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:14.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.57,0:06:17.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll give you lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:19.42,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:22.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please, these are for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:24.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please, help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wonderful tissues. Help yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:32.48,KM,Shimamoto,0000,0000,0000,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:34.31,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:35.91,KM,Shimamoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:37.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:40.61,KM,Shimamoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t loiter in the middle of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:41.92,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:49.63,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That person… from before…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.41,KM,Shimamoto,0000,0000,0000,,Pick up the tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let me thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:11.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure he went this way…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:18.01,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,The sheet flew!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:19.83,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:23.45,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:25.01,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:28.34,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:31.75,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Your nose got scraped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:32.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:34.26,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,It’s true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:37.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:39.54,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It’s rude to laugh at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.69,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:46.69,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry. I work here at Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:50.40,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,We’re short-handed, so I was bringing in the laundry late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:51.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:53.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re short-handed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.30,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:57.96,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it troublesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.73,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I-I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.73,0:08:02.08,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Since you’d need a hand, can I help out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:03.27,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:05.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Can I help out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.50,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:11.28,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:14.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please, take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:20.82,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:27.40,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what’s your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:28.82,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Toshihiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Hanato Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:34.29,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? That’s a weird name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.98,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Weird name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:40.83,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:43.54,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Is your father named Obato, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:45.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, he isn’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:46.73,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Then what’s his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:48.54,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,What’s his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:49.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:50.81,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,What’s his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:52.04,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:53.24,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:56.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:01.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:05.23,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you have a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:08.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Probably not…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:14.84,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,We don’t need his name. Let’s play!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:18.49,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kids, don’t bother her too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:21.24,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:24.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, is there anything I can help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:28.65,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Just accompanying the kids is helping enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Accompanying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:33.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:35.24,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.28,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:38.19,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:42.69,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I can’t play the organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:44.20,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:45.83,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:48.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But we can all dance together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:49.98,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:50.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.05,0:09:52.29,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:57.72,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-sensei, play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:06.14,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,We’re going to dance with Kobato-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:08.52,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t think she’s a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.69,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:14.74,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you’ll accomplish by following people around?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:18.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:21.22,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:25.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I said I’d help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.48,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You can’t play the organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:29.92,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:32.36,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You’re useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:38.93,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Are you two friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:40.03,KM,Kobato and Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, we’re not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:42.36,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:46.01,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,This is Fujimoto Kiyokazu-kun, whom I work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:49.81,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,This is Kobato-chan. I’m counting on you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:50.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:54.61,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:01.20,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-sensei! Hurry and play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:03.92,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:06.11,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’m counting on you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:17.47,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Dance, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.61,0:11:24.87,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.81,0:11:31.97,KT,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-This person is so unkind. But I’m not giving in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:38.61,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan’s so funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.42,0:11:41.59,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,So weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:00.40,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Break~!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:18.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is this a place where children live?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:23.27,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,They don’t live here, but we do look after them in the afternoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.27,0:12:24.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.68,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But this place is really worn-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:35.45,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,A new preschool just opened, so fewer kids come here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:42.81,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But, we need to do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:46.49,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it’s useless to worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:50.08,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yup! You’re right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:56.23,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. You really helped us and the kids looked like they had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:13:00.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-It was nothing. I only played with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:02.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It always makes Ioryogi-san mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:05.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:08.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! Ioryogi-san isn’t here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.87,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,There was someone with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:16.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. He’s not really someone, but rather, a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:21.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He can’t talk, so if I don’t go get him, he’ll be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:24.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:28.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,May I come back again tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:30.68,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,If you could…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:32.30,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:36.19,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We don’t know where she lives or what she’s doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:37.96,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is it really okay for her to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:42.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not like that! I’m Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:45.68,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,All we know is your name. That’s all you ever say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:46.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.94,0:13:48.09,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:56.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve been searching for many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:13:58.16,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:03.27,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,If it’s not a problem for Kobato-chan, we gladly accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:06.82,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just that we can’t really give you any money for helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:12.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s okay. I just want to be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:14.48,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Then we’ll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.43,0:14:21.64,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:23.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:25.61,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let me tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:30.18,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you feel sorry for us or are just curious, then don’t come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:30.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:36.64,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a bother having people think you’re pitiable or have it hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.92,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t think that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:48.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:14:59.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:04.07,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It {\i1}is{\i0} a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:09.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Leaving someone behind in the middle of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:13.32,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t it great that I found you, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:14.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:18.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know how difficult it is to try to move amongst people, little by little, while they’re staring at you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.72,0:15:20.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:23.82,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you! I’m a stuffed animal here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:26.51,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Stuffed animals can’t just walk around!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:27.68,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:32.82,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You get the bottle and then just forget about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.13,0:15:35.29,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Just as I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:44.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean? You thought something would be in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:51.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I guess the things I’m doing aren’t healing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:57.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Instead, I wonder if I’m just a bother…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:03.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like something is hurting Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:09.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But he said I was bothersome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:13.26,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody thinks that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:18.53,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In this world, there are those who are hurt and those who aren’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:25.94,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Among those who are hurt are those who wish to be healed and those who don’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.72,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:30.26,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.66,0:16:31.74,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:34.51,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:40.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.11,0:16:44.85,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to heal them, then just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:47.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:51.19,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Good or bad, it doesn’t matter. You just need to think about healing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:02.99,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.70,KO,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:04.73,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:04.73,KO,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.11,0:17:06.65,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,We have to hurry home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:15.74,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:20.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:23.51,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:27.48,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What about preschool? Are you going home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:31.63,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but not yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:38.20,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like the swings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:45.81,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Not that much. But I’ll stay here a little longer until Mom gets back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:51.93,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,It’s her job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:54.13,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Her job, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:54.85,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.77,0:17:58.89,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,…she’s trying really hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:03.46,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,The divorce was tough, but she still makes breakfast for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.87,0:18:06.40,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,She’s nice. Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:08.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:09.62,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:14.32,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,You’re not gonna say it? That it’s bad…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:31.33,KP,Woman 1,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun, your mother’s not coming to pick you up today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:32.42,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:38.79,KP,Woman 1,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,800)}Oh… you’re so understanding and unselfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:46.30,KP,Woman 2,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,800)}Today too? You’re so good to be waiting patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:52.35,KP,Woman 3,0000,0000,0000,,It’d be nice if your mother would think about you a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:53.80,KP,Woman 3.5,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,700)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:19:00.75,KP,Woman 4,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,600)}How much work can she have? It really is bad parenting, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:07.44,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone says I have a bad mom, and that what she’s doing is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:11.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What she’s doing is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:14.36,KM,Toshiko,0000,0000,0000,,No! She’s trying her hardest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:18.38,KM,Toshiko,0000,0000,0000,,Really! She’s really great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:24.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.03,0:19:34.28,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A mother who tries her best is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:37.23,KM,Toshikiko,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:40.65,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! She’s a wonderful mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,W-What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.99,0:20:01.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:03.35,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.39,0:20:05.83,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:09.02,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Uh huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:37.20,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:43.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-There’s something inside, but what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:46.85,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s from that Toshihiko kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:49.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:54.73,KP,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:59.05,KP,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Keep trying, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:02.39,KP,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun, you’re too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:05.24,KP,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t push harder…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:16.94,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He was happy that you said nice things about his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:25.16,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was nice? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:30.68,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You will never heal anybody if you’re\Ninsincere, even if you are nice about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:34.32,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay to do what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:38.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:43.21,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll do my best collecting people’s broken hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:45.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:50.14,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll sound like you’re going to break their hearts if you put it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:52.56,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then, their mended hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:57.38,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds like you’re going to take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:22:01.21,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What should we call it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:04.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Argh, what a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:07.79,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That looks like confetti candy, so confetti is okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.17,0:22:10.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Confetti?{konpeitou:confetti candy}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.79,0:22:16.76,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I understand! Then let’s call this confetti!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:19.14,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:19.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:31.07,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Leaving me behind was inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.07,0:22:33.17,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But you were good for your first try.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:36.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why I am ignoring it and giving you 100 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.12,0:22:40.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead and keep this up\Nwith high spirits, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.11,0:22:44.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’ll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:48.46,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Even though you got 100 points, don’t get too ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:50.87,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But you said to go ahead and keep this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.87,0:22:52.66,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:55.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then how do I go ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.23,0:22:57.89,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s it! I’m taking your points away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.89,0:22:59.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:00.40,KM,Next,0000,0000,0000,,The Rain’s Gift
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
